## 7. Archived V1.0 publication record

`BH_Kernhypothese_Erdmodul_V1_0_Publication.pdf` remains preserved in this
repository as the original V1.0 publication record. Repository history and
`SHA256SUMS.txt` document provenance/integrity. CC BY 4.0 permits adaptations
of original project content, but altered copies must be identified as changed
and must not be passed off as the unchanged archived original.
